<title>SINGAPORE: SABIC wins Bangchak Aug MTBE tender -- source.</title>
<headline>SABIC wins Bangchak Aug MTBE tender -- source.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC) was awarded a tender to supply 1,500 tonnes of August methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) to Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc, a company source said on Monday.</p>
<p>A Bangchak source said earlier it awarded the tender at $270-$275 per tonne, cost-and-freight Bangkok August 16-31.</p>
<p>But the SABIC source said the awarded prices was at the high end of $270-$280 per tonne.</p>
</text>
